<title>POLAND: AMERBANK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.83 vs    0.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.45 vs    0.42</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.06 vs    2.60</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 4.73 vs    4.08</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.71 vs    4.75</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   12.50 vs    6.88</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 32.31 vs   31.35</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	41.66 vs   36.44</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Amerykanski w</p>
<p>Polsce Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
